{
  "name": "05_Confirm_And_Create_Event",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05_Confirm_And_Create_Event — Idempotency\n1) **Khóa nguyên tử**: `UPDATE proposed_slots SET status='confirming' ... status='pending' AND expires_at > GETDATE()` (WF09 `lock_slot`).\n2) Lock 0 dòng → `ALREADY_PROCESSED` / `PROPOSAL_EXPIRED`.\n3) Tạo Google Calendar lỗi → slot `failed` (cho phép bấm thử lại; `lock_slot` với `allow_retry` chấp nhận failed/slot_taken). Google event id **cố định** `aisec<request_id><slot>` ⇒ gọi lại trả 409, không tạo trùng.\n4) Đối soát SQL: `insert_event` idempotent theo `google_event_id`; lỗi ghi → tra lại `events` theo `google_event_id` trước khi báo lỗi.\nInput: `{ user_id, confirm_action: create|replace_conflict, request_id, selected_slot_code, delete_event_id? }`.\nOutput: `{ response: {...} }` (status `created | slot_taken | error`).",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "16133110-ce21-45d5-beec-744b94f18eaa",
      "name": "Ghi chú",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "93ece2da-4188-4ed7-9b47-fe1026d11b79",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        48,
        624
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const p = $input.first().json || {};\nconst errors = [];\n\n// Ép kiểu an toàn trước khi gọi toLowerCase(), tránh crash khi biến bị undefined\nconst rawMode = p.confirm_action || p.sub_action || p.mode || 'create';\nconst mode = String(rawMode).toLowerCase().trim();\n\nif (!['create', 'replace_conflict'].includes(mode)) {\n  errors.push('confirm_action phai la create hoac replace_conflict');\n}\n\nconst userId = String(p.user_id || p.user_email || '').trim();\nif (!userId) {\n  errors.push('thieu user_id');\n}\n\nconst isBatchEvents = Array.isArray(p.events) && p.events.length > 0;\n\nif (isBatchEvents) {\n  p.events.forEach((ev, idx) => {\n    if (!ev || !ev.title) errors.push(`Su kien [${idx + 1}]: Thieu title`);\n    if (!ev || !ev.date_range_start) errors.push(`Su kien [${idx + 1}]: Thieu date_range_start`);\n    if (!ev || !ev.specific_start_time) errors.push(`Su kien [${idx + 1}]: Thieu specific_start_time`);\n  });\n} else {\n  const rid = Number.parseInt(p.request_id, 10);\n  if (!Number.isInteger(rid) || rid <= 0) {\n    errors.push('request_id phai la so nguyen duong');\n  }\n  const code = String(p.selected_slot_code || '').toUpperCase().trim();\n  if (!/^S[1-9]$/.test(code)) {\n    errors.push('selected_slot_code khong hop le (S1, S2, S3)');\n  }\n}\n\nif (mode === 'replace_conflict' && !p.delete_event_id) {\n  errors.push('thieu delete_event_id');\n}\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      valid: false,\n      response: {\n        status: 'error',\n        error_code: 'INVALID_INPUT',\n        message: errors.join('; ')\n      }\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nconst reqId = isBatchEvents ? 1 : Number.parseInt(p.request_id, 10);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: true,\n    operation: 'get_request',\n    data: { request_id: reqId },\n    creation_type: isBatchEvents ? 'batch_events' : 'single_slot',\n    user_id: userId,\n    mode: mode,\n    request_id: reqId,\n    selected_slot_code: isBatchEvents ? 'S1' : String(p.selected_slot_code || 'S1').toUpperCase(),\n    events: p.events || null,\n    selected_slots: p.selected_slots || null\n  }\n}];"
      },
